                               ·PURPOSE·
-============================================================================-

 A nice dezigned pager for any bbs. Nothing special with it really.

-============================================================================-


                            ·REQUIREMENTS·
-============================================================================-

 Any AmiExpress version ranging from v2.xx-v3.xx
 Don't know if it will work with any version less or higher, test!

-============================================================================-


                            ·INSTALLATION·
-============================================================================-

 AE 3.xx:

 - Copy the Pager directory directly to DOORS:
 - Copy O.info to BBS:COMMANDS/BBCMD/

 AE 2.xx:

 - Copy the Pager directory directly to DOORS:
 - Then add this to your BBS:COMMANDS/BBS.cmd file

 *O        XM001DOORS:PAGER/PAGER.X
  ^        ^ ^  ^
  |        | |  `--> Location of the door
  |        | `-----> Access needed to run the door
  |        `-------> MUST begin on column 11
  `----------------> Command to star the door with

-============================================================================-

                                 ·USAGE·
-============================================================================-

 Type O at the main screen in AmiExpress, there will come up a screen either
 saying: State your buisness, or say that the sysop isn't availiable for chat
 right now do you want to leave him a message.

-============================================================================-

                            ·ERROR MESSAGES·
-============================================================================-

 There are no error messages at this moment.

-============================================================================-

                       ·SUGGESTIONS & BUGREPORTS·
-============================================================================-

 If there by any chance should occur any problem or you should find a bug
 in this door then you can contact me or leave me a message on my board:

                      CHaOS    +46 (0)8 550 19819

-============================================================================-

                                 ·NOTE·
-============================================================================-

 This program has ONLY been tested with /X 3.35

